---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How affiliate links and commissions are disclosed on SecureByteGuide.">
  <article class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-12"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-mono text-accent mb-4">SecureByteGuide · Trust</p><h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-[0.95] mb-4" style="font-family:var(--font-display);">Affiliate Disclosure</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: September 6, 2026</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
<section><h2>Plain-language disclosure</h2><p>Some SecureByteGuide pages may contain affiliate links. If you follow one and make a qualifying purchase, SecureByteGuide may receive a commission from the seller. The commission does not change the price you pay, although prices and eligibility can change at the merchant.</p></section>
<section><h2>Identification and independence</h2><p>An article with an affiliate relationship should display a disclosure near the relevant content. A partner cannot pay for a favorable conclusion or remove a material limitation. Recommendations identify the official specifications, research, regulator guidance, or other evidence relevant to the decision and state important limits.</p></section>
<section><h2>Programs and merchant responsibility</h2><p>SecureByteGuide may participate in Amazon Associates or other topic-relevant affiliate programs. As an Amazon Associate, SecureByteGuide may earn from qualifying purchases when Amazon links are used. The merchant controls price, inventory, delivery, returns, warranties, and customer support. SecureByteGuide is not the seller.</p></section>
<section><h2>Reader choice</h2><p>You do not need to use an affiliate link. Compare current price, privacy, support, compatibility, renewal terms, and cancellation rules directly with the provider before buying.</p></section>
<section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about a link or commercial relationship can be sent to <a href="mailto:editor@securebyteguide.org">editor@securebyteguide.org</a>.</p></section></div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
